forced to wake up because<i>..</i>

922
01:31:45,909 --> 01:31:49,709
<i>..</i>he was in terror to see so
many of his soldiers killed one<i>..</i>

923
01:31:49,913 --> 01:31:53,713
<i>..</i>after the other. Oh yes, he
needs Kumbhkarna. but even he is<i>..</i>

924
01:31:53,917 --> 01:31:55,714
<i>..</i>not immortal. He is mighty
enough to make all the<i>..</i>

925
01:31:55,919 --> 01:31:57,716
<i>..</i> vanara soldiers run
away in panic<i>..</i>

926
01:31:57,921 --> 01:32:00,719
<i>..</i>by his appearance. But Ram<i>..</i>

927
