937
01:34:02,712 --> 01:34:05,510
The mightiest warrior of Lanka.

938
01:34:05,715 --> 01:34:09,515
Now this Hanuman
is your opponent.

939
01:34:09,719 --> 01:34:12,517
Good<i>..</i> Good.

940
01:34:13,556 --> 01:34:15,524
But before we fight<i>..</i> here.

941
01:34:20,563 --> 01:34:23,532
Oh<i>..</i> Kumbha<i>..</i>
