These herbs were far better
than l ever expected.

1042
01:46:18,280 --> 01:46:21,249
But wait! Just a
handful of these herbs<i>..</i>

1043
01:46:21,450 --> 01:46:24,248
<i>..</i>won't be enough
to heal them all.

1044
01:46:26,288 --> 01:46:29,257
Now<i>..</i> let me think.

1045
01:46:35,297 --> 01:46:38,266
